@Reservas_HostAddress = http://localhost:5192

### ==================== SALAS ====================

### Cadastrar sala
POST {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/salas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Sala Alfa",
  "andar": "1",
  "capacidade": 10
}

### Listar salas
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/salas
Accept: application/json

### Obter sala por id
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/salas/1
Accept: application/json

### Obter sala inexistente (404)
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/salas/9999
Accept: application/json

### Desativar sala
PATCH {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/salas/1/desativar

### ==================== RESERVAS ====================

### Criar reserva
POST {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salaId": 1,
  "responsavel": "Maria Silva",
  "inicio": "2027-03-01T10:00:00",
  "fim": "2027-03-01T11:00:00",
  "numeroParticipantes": 5
}

### Criar reserva em conflito de horario (409)
POST {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salaId": 1,
  "responsavel": "Joao Souza",
  "inicio": "2027-03-01T10:30:00",
  "fim": "2027-03-01T11:30:00",
  "numeroParticipantes": 3
}

### Criar reserva com participantes acima da capacidade
POST {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "salaId": 1,
  "responsavel": "Ana Lima",
  "inicio": "2027-03-02T10:00:00",
  "fim": "2027-03-02T11:00:00",
  "numeroParticipantes": 999
}

### Obter reserva por id
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas/1
Accept: application/json

### Listar reservas (paginacao padrao)
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas
Accept: application/json

### Listar reservas com paginacao
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas?pagina=1&tamanho=5
Accept: application/json

### Listar reservas por sala
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas?salaId=1
Accept: application/json

### Listar reservas por periodo (ate so com data = dia inteiro incluido)
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas?de=2027-03-01&ate=2027-03-01
Accept: application/json

### Listar reservas por periodo (ate com hora = inclusivo)
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas?de=2027-03-01T00:00:00&ate=2027-03-01T10:00:00
Accept: application/json

### Listar reservas com tamanho invalido (400)
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas?tamanho=100
Accept: application/json

### Listar reservas com pagina invalida (400)
GET {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas?pagina=0
Accept: application/json

### Cancelar reserva
PATCH {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas/1/cancelar

### Cancelar reserva inexistente (404)
PATCH {{Reservas_HostAddress}}/reservas/9999/cancelar
